      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "1. Users should be able to create and like posts\n2. Users should be able to search posts by keyword\n3. Users should be able to get search results sorted by recency or like count",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Users should be able to create and like posts\n2. Users should be able to search posts by keyword\n3. Users should be able to get search results sorted by recency or like count",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 69
