      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "- Eventual Consistency for viewing new posts (or edits) or like counts, etc\n- High Scalability for writes and reads since our number of users is 1B\n- Fast Response Time <500ms for searching posts by keyword\n- New posts should be indexed & searchable within 1 minute of posting",
